        <mxCell id="p1-where" value="&lt;b&gt;Where each step is in the website&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Explore: destinations.html and the 4 season pages&lt;br&gt;- Hotels &amp;amp; chalets: hotels.html, chalets.html (search, filter, sort, details)&lt;br&gt;- Plan a trip: flight.html, bus-train.html (form with validation + summary)&lt;br&gt;- Contact: contact.html (form with validation + confirmation)&lt;br&gt;- Login, reservations and admin: backend (Node.js + Express + MySQL)&lt;br&gt;  with the tables USERS, DESTINATIONS, ACCOMMODATIONS, BOOKINGS, TICKETS" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#3B3200;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
