        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2-vrules" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules checked in the browser now&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trip planners (flight.js, bus-train.js):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- From and To are filled in and not the same place&lt;br&gt;- Departure date is today or later&lt;br&gt;- Return date is on or after the departure date&lt;br&gt;- 1 to 9 travelers, and a cabin / seat / class is chosen&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contact form (contact.js):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Name, topic and message are required&lt;br&gt;- Message is max 2000 characters&lt;br&gt;- Email must look like name@example.com&lt;br&gt;- Phone is optional (6 to 17 digits)" style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#3B3200;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="35" y="885" width="440" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p2-rnote" value="&lt;b&gt;Note&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Right now the planners and the stay pages stop at the&lt;br&gt;summary, so nothing is really booked yet. The dashed&lt;br&gt;steps will work when the backend is finished. Online&lt;br&gt;payment is not part of this project." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontColor=#3B3200;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
